## Product Summary

DealOS is a browser-based B2B quotation-to-cash platform for Sales Reps, Sales Managers, Finance/Operations, Customers, and Admins. It governs discounts, recommends cross-sells, routes approvals, negotiates quotation revisions through a restricted customer portal, reserves stock across warehouses, supports one-time and recurring billing, records payments, and surfaces deal-health alerts and reports.

The application stack is fixed: React + TypeScript frontend; Node.js + Express + TypeScript REST backend; PostgreSQL with Prisma; separate `frontend/`, `backend/`, and `backend/docs/`; no mobile application.

